<title>USA: Sun Co Inc Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Sun Co Inc Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter			    1997		    1996</p>
<p> Revenues			$2,744,000,000	$2,472,000,000</p>
<p>Income (Loss) from Continuing</p>
<p>  Operations			 18,000,000	  (24,000,000)</p>
<p>Income from Discontinued</p>
<p>  Operations				   --	    19,000,000</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		 18,000,000	   (5,000,000)</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss) per Share</p>
<p>  of Common Stock(A)(B)		   .10		   (.22)</p>
<p>Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>  (In Millions)			    73.0		    73.9</p>
<p>(A)  After provision for dividends on preference shares.</p>
<p>(B)  Represents both primary and fully diluted earnings per share.</p>
<p>Company said it had 1997 operating income of $39 million, or $0.38 per shr. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
